"An entrustment skill works only on what another person entrusts; it cannot be used alone."
"Entrusting can be done by System message, e.g. '[Haoyu: I entrust!]'."
"The holder senses an entruster's position as a pull and can track them through a city."
"Preserving a partly non-physical object's crumbs strains the skill as its unseen aspects fade."
"A preserved object keeps its momentum, so a spun object released later flies at full speed."
"Entrustment forges a connection that raises the skill's authority by the entruster's own."
"Such a skill grows stronger when its holder suffers on the entruster's behalf."
